  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundo Casa - Environmental management of indigenous lands part 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With grants channelled through Fundo Casa, 33 indigenous association will expand their project management capabilities in the administrative, financial and operational areas in order to implement projects improving territorial environmental management, while also promoting an expanded socioeconomic and political participation, in particular of indigenous women.</narrative>
  </description>
